= Template Validation Lua Module Specification =

== Executive Summary ==

This document specifies the Lua module architecture for BITwiki template validation, implementing the three-tier validation model (TemplateData L1, Lua L2, SMW Schema L3). It provides complete module definitions, validation functions, error handling, and integration patterns for epistemic document templates.

