== 7. Testing Procedures ==

=== 7.1 Unit Test Cases ===

| Test Case | Input | Expected Result |
|-----------|-------|-----------------|
| Valid epistemic status | `epistemic_status=Established` | Pass, SMW markup generated |
| Invalid epistemic status | `epistemic_status=Unknown` | Error: must be one of... |
| Confidence out of range | `confidence=1.5` | Error: must be between 0.0 and 1.0 |
| Missing required field | `title=` (empty) | Error: Required parameter 'title'... |
| Valid confidence | `confidence=0.75` | Pass, formatted as 0.75 |

